WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.280
Lilliput Group was established in 1993

2
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.480
and is an ISO certified original design manufacturer

3
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:21.480
specialized in the engineering and manufacturing of electronic and computer related products.

4
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.080
The group has two brands, Lilliput and OWON.

5
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.780
OWON Smart Life is Lilliput's Canadian division

6
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:36.280
focusing on the design and manufacturing of home energy management systems and smart home devices.

7
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:43.040
Backed up with a solid technical foundation in embedded computer systems

8
00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.040
and by partnering with major industry players

9
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:52.040
OWON integrates smart energy and IoT technologies into its technology mix

10
00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:57.040
offering both standardized products and customized solutions for utilities

11
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.040
contractors, distributors, as well as home builders.

12
00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:07.050
OWON Smart Energy Solutions successfully integrates

13
00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:12.050
the home energy management and smart home application into one single system

14
00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:17.050
using the smart energy gateway that various communication modules are equipped with

15
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:21.050
thus integrates the smart meter, smart energy devices

16
00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:25.050
and home automation components into the home area network

17
00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.050
and further connects to a cloud

18
00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:31.050
allowing two-way message exchange in between.

19
00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:35.050
With the help of OWON's cloud server and mobile apps

20
00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:40.050
people will be able to monitor and even control their home energy usage away from home.

21
00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:56.200
OWON Smart Test is China's leading producer of digital oscilloscopes for science and technology.

22
00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:01.200
Lilliput Electronics is a leading maker of mini-color LCD

23
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.200
and embedded computer applications in China.

24
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:11.930
Let's now take a quick tour of the Lilliput engineering and manufacturing facilities.

25
00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.930
Lilliput designs multi-layer printed circuit boards

26
00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.930
with the latest CAD tools.

27
00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:22.930
Mechanical enclosure or packaging is also designed by this department.

28
00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:33.070
Lilliput's engineers are expert at writing, testing and debugging embedded system software.

29
00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:37.070
Here our engineer is developing and testing software

30
00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:42.070
using the EmberZigBee Alliance certified development system.

31
00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.070
Lilliput's factory engineering department

32
00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.070
encourages team spirit and collaboration.

33
00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:50.070
When difficult issues are encountered

34
00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.070
team members come together to solve those issues.

35
00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.730
Lilliput's factory floor layout has been designed

36
00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.730
to promote maximum efficiency

37
00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.730
while at the same time providing the utmost

38
00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:05.730
comfortable, well-lit and healthy working conditions

39
00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:09.300
for all its employees.

40
00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:13.300
The heart and soul of Lilliput's electronic assembly and production

41
00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.300
is its state-of-the-art surface-mounted technology

42
00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:23.300
Panasonic pick-and-place line.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:37.350
SMT assembly and testing.

43
00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.350
Two-hole parts are carefully hand-soldered

44
00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:41.350
using lead-free soldering techniques

45
00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:44.350
and vented air systems.

46
00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.350
Lilliput has been a global leader

47
00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:49.350
in the production of touch-sensitive LCD displays

48
00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.350
for over a decade.

49
00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.350
Our pressurized clean room

50
00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.350
with controlled air-scrubbing access

51
00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.350
insures the highest quality product production

52
00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.350
for years of trouble-free operation.

53
00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:07.090
Lilliput manages two standards-

54
00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.090
calibration and incoming inspection laboratories.

55
00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.090
These are used to maintain the complete

56
00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:15.090
computerized factory operations.

57
00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:17.090
At the point of final assembly

58
00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.090
each and every product Lilliput builds

59
00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.090
is actively tested under computer control

60
00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.090
and carefully inspected for every detail

61
00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:27.090
by each assembly station operator.

62
00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:30.090
Lilliput's stringent ISO 9002

63
00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:32.090
stressed total quality management

64
00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:35.090
with a zero-defects policy.

65
00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.090
The final step for each product

66
00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.090
is the engraving of a unique serial number

67
00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:44.110
on the product's enclosure.

68
00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.110
Lilliput's tooling fabrication department

69
00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.110
produces all of the hard-steel tooling

70
00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:50.110
necessary to put mechanical enclosures

71
00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.110
and other injected plastic parts

72
00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:54.110
into production, without the need

73
00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:57.110
to use the service of subcontracting tool

74
00:04:57.110 --> 00:05:01.110
and diproducers.

75
00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.110
Lilliput is capable of designing

76
00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.110
the most intricate tooling,testing it

77
00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.110
in production injection molding machinery

78
00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.110
certifying the results to exacting

79
00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:12.110
standards of form and fit parameters.
